{"id":"036c236cd4d7e31c","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-lem-cofinality-increase.md","title":"Cofinality Increase","display":"lem-cofinality-increase — Cofinality Increase","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-cofinality-increase","aliases":["58-lem-cofinality-increase"],"display":"lem-cofinality-increase — Cofinality Increase","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-cofinality-increase"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-cofinality-increase</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-cofinality-increase — Cofinality Increase"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,f,\\alpha,\\xi\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,f,\\alpha,\\xi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (共尾数函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}\">\\(\\mathrm{Reg}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal alias and cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (ordinal-valued function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedBelow}_S(f,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedBelow}_S(f,\\lambda)\\)</span> (range-bounded-in-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}below\\text{-}lambda} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedBelow}_S(f,\\lambda) \\leftrightarrow \\exists \\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\forall \\xi\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\;(f(\\xi)\\leq\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}below\\text{-}lambda} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedBelow}_S(f,\\lambda) \\leftrightarrow \\exists \\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\forall \\xi\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\;(f(\\xi)\\leq\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}cofinality-increase} \\vdash (\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\kappa&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\lambda)) \\to \\forall f\\in\\lambda^\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{BoundedBelow}_S(f,\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}cofinality-increase} \\vdash (\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\kappa&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\lambda)) \\to \\forall f\\in\\lambda^\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{BoundedBelow}_S(f,\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\">\\(\\kappa&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\\)</span>, every function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\kappa\\to\\lambda\">\\(f:\\kappa\\to\\lambda\\)</span> has its entire range bounded below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Regularity of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is retained from the stated application, although the range-boundedness argument only needs <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{dom}(f)|&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\">\\(|\\operatorname{dom}(f)|&lt;\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}$ (共尾数函数, see [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,f,\\alpha,\\xi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedBelow}_S(f,\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}below\\text{-}lambda} \\vdash \\mathrm{BoundedBelow}_S(f,\\lambda) \\leftrightarrow \\exists \\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\\forall \\xi\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\;(f(\\xi)\\leq\\alpha)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}cofinality-increase} \\vdash (\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\kappa<\\mathrm{cf}(\\lambda)) \\to \\forall f\\in\\lambda^\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{BoundedBelow}_S(f,\\lambda)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa<\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\kappa\\to\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{dom}(f)|<\\operatorname{cf}(\\lambda)","display":false}],"bytes":1466,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3881","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-lem-cofinality-increase.md|58-lem-cofinality-increase]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["315ad00b8744fdfc","5fb1c2241d1943d1","d83de8696e4dad26"]}